    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c7700317334e1daebbcde7c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP完全恢复了。\\n……所以？比还是不比？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e855bc9dec4b2e2ae7b1ff131dfb16d695950ca1de6d56a561b62d2d62cd11db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:932c7efa2c09152e5acc947a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了呢。\\n为了能展现出出色的跑风，我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53594c3feaef51aa20633be62df318c0bc1b16317dfc21391421c417d39e46f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:443ff5de7c8ec118b225487b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听我说听我说ー！听说RP满了！！\\n那个，呃……也就是说可以跑很多次了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1b10d180fcd5c92557dfcd6d3e364543cc6ce32a1c088dd1601b14a045b0934",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81b930a447cb1eb6c4f2e2ef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了！！\\n那么，去堂堂正正地一决胜负吧！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83283033aca3e3d8dd06fa0839d88d7b003e5574975e6e3465e0610d86380b49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70864ef5347abd6bbe9aef47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满啦！胡萝卜素能量全开！！\\n马上出战赛事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b70b43e5bfa5ad6ad7beaff7fd0a0685c4bb1341c1db9aa314dc5236a157ae1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35760896a91283362d8fd2ae",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经MAX了哟っ☆★☆可以参加赛事了っ！\\nMarvelous即将诞生！也就是Ma～rvelou～s★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "291c61638cfa7b5376f655a7c0e6ad6af481147362e9c00e3850880315c9e75b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b625da619501aab0d79a18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了！……姆呵呵！\\n占卜说我在赛事里会……呼呼呼～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8787c55c55ebedc36e3c14969dc64ebfd3735ab6dab9afe6732c36d005a87654",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78682e6c1782ef155fe05988",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP满了。\\n能跑的时候，就想多跑跑呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "036c588c98b1bbab991d497db01a86bcacaa089ab6f0c72e556789ac729826fc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6a50ca662e9c94162f2c1b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了～。为了不出错，到赛事开始前\\n都要乖乖地——呀啊啊啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9530cec3ad504a64bb75be1fb8afb99f0bd3ab53acbf39c17435e2e68dc9b035",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b90f1c853bc45003694372aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了。\\n快让我跑吧……我想变强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b60b78d0d0784d9f863ddf76b76fa5db22fd8bfd6e02db1d4a787bfe4f75da98",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69bb07157f3313584a0d93ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哦，RP好像攒满了呢。那么，\\n年轻人们闪闪发光地参加赛事的时间到了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e18afb17b57536b83258a065cf2b9643bffb2e380415c8938ac8c6c5aa62c86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5aee718186ee87e1dd101c2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了呢。接下来只要在赛事里，\\n把配得上King的胜利拿到手就行了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4700397d4bb80aebe7b5de09345ac4e958cb1217406cd381616e3524dca4dab6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1ecf92a96e83fb7f7b428c7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "邦邦邦～！RP已经满了！\\n在赛事里“嗖——”地冲起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "feaf5536b26a43a163a8008279347a783d4f93c5ad9bc8b5a17057c22e971281",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e73d91df3c61c2493e5c4bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "确认RP已恢复。可以出战赛事。\\n让您看看日常调整的成果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58a1b821174d88196c19e7ab3ba5df2fd83f885f6036e09c2e98eb2221edb036",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1063"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40d8e077d6d31605aa19ccf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦。\\n和善信一起大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f1bb22f0aab60178fa9dd78071cdd6a0970f3696953c33bf87cb961e39797b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1064"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ee28dedd44ec0a78fd7920b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "LANE：酱太阳神\\n训P～！RP满了！只能Fes起来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64294f4733b6509a15a7e50861380162397048b94a88d3bdeeba0ef946fd9b37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1065"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5274c23cb40a7ff57a6df41f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！\\n快让我跑！快点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8183bc326c90e957ba3a61f3030d7d7966a47194c2e4aa2a46452acd507ba2e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d9bcd3e3d9e366a7c1d73c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像攒满了！\\n可以参加赛事吗？怎么样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "56a752f057c57ac93b3721822e2959750e63423c21fc2e6abdf13698f8a289c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f04501bb29e8f837b3bd3a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像满了……！\\n在赛事里Washoi！热闹起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24af6b98b536f015e68d5434cc03605b25994a3c23c747d079b4ef946655d926",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ffe25d5a8421d8b372a7c47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经完全恢复到全部盛开啦！\\n请一定要看看我一点一滴努力的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4e4ac77048cde2e082a81fabb3e15f26120fa445b25c9980d3b381d15ba7b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bd0271949b3b9afc5ed04c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那么，RP满了。我也准备好了……\\n要做的事，只有一件了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "063e7f2a5eb37369d5f0073417a6e5b941bffd8cbfe5f52daf36798da92dad29",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bcef7851e4865ac7870830b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经完全恢复了呢。\\n让我们去抓住赛事的光辉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a55036969dd096d3711d9e8eca1e3e01d3c4b0a76e98d77d11ada23442859c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35af8b8c0f1ed4915442c256",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了！\\n在赛事中，向您展示修行的成果吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b84613cf9fa2f7a76ae8491f17daf65d1c2421ce1e6b19a23151f9f8e02d4a9a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd54863ff24a1d8b42bdb279",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已满！随时都可以跑！\\n现在就去——呜喔喔喔霍……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc9e68234cb11b3f988af35677002e4300d9d742222be13c700561476aef8a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8430e990ccf869b8ac5b8acb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经全部恢复了～。\\n那么，喝完茶就……出发吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1035ef85c7f27773108c2feb4eb56679f109bce209e6950e99d4f6aa9503b75",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb84071ca7e640cc6c19e863",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦ー！\\n那么，去华丽地绽放吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03f25ef5e01fe6fd395480af94ff737e920c89745392a5bae0faf54f8bd5da10",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7c203611f54afa02910668",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像满了！\\n我会跑出回应大家期待的赛事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a10d3f91e7aec619fafaf6abf96ce93112868e2e9266bfc2cb8604f9f3c18e22",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:403b68608911017a018338be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经全部恢复了哦。\\n那么，去草地赛场上飞驰吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9938060a763bd0379fa92eafedeeb9ab3369bac84bbddd637e8c947dae7d136a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c474642e0d4774ab7042c74",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了。出发，前往赛场。\\n迈出打倒中央的第一步吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd865edc59b6662492c07db7fff3ed885fc86ff7a0d0b4e2316d832fe5255e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf95286ae24a0f24e3b392c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了，要去比赛吗？\\n情报的话我早就查好了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1364e7a3c056a1ee6195ab43a6ad8b5811ab83ed868a6674cb8e1c20ea8b25d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b332ae4461eeb8201ae5630",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了……比赛时间到了……！\\n让你们见识见识我才是最强的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "116365da8fbc6e4258a481821b50c17c47e833fe5cc3b7606d41ca3cfd4128c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b4975557b9be6b74f3a81f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了。\\n来吧，用光辉来装饰赛事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bd171d73d7af2dc6a51c428b20edd2c9cdf81df44d6d8ea30743a70338c05e3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13e5dd46eee7a1035db4f2f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "报告。RP已完全恢复。\\n待命至出战为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e174ca18e70e1e8fd2655be8a002eb153af0f80f0874649f792051762ade73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:625ad0fed8bb8dbc3618c689",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已满……来吧，破坏的时刻到了！！\\n去吧，向着赛事——向着战斗的舞台！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b2e0f50a39156d909393d9446768a6e5260244cf27a4f5505c27e4f3a1bd643",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04a947cf8584d0cabb1d7a1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已满。为了留下功绩，\\n现在应该尽可能多地积累胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b888bd880387570ad809578b28b7831b96aa85edb5f7903eeda7f782eab060f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:692cacfa316aeff5d9055e52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP已经完全恢复了。\\n赛事的准备，已经完美就绪……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ab96c09227613e9a6f92bf106b36d07a0f5d98fc71c1ea35a6353864716da6e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfcbbaabc393e698a981f7ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【真弓快报】\\nRP满了。好厉害。可以参加赛事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02b2647065c059acfaa4f24487f57c8be00f7a065f3c5e54cc6fee8ec077c0b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e9c6cfa8ecc4545b03009a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像完全恢复了！\\n我会做好准备的，随时都可以来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0eccd8daaae4ba90811eb34200f31f38aad62f300c23961fc5ba95cf20962e7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced3646c3f3398f2cddd9ca1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像恢复了。……那，那个！\\n为了随时都能出发，我会做好准备的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6556f92676c885c4665c63de297f40cc9c4916d14e0bfc1cae77e2e59c2e7612",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e811f26ec2ddbd7725e59e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像恢复了。希望我的跑姿，\\n能给那些孩子们带来好的刺激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f410d4b1618c3da590c374e4fb4fcc12e1de4ec13c9ded184e6ba9a977a60d0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e88afe0ac683b0ff21b51c9d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说RP攒满了！\\n我跑步的样子，可绝对不能错过ー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "95d4cbce5a06b0193059482f27a397155da052c9336e797e66bc9763d6953095",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb48d74b47490fc9a1d2d672",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！\\n我会先做好热身运动的！",
