      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d1e45e54da0d99576f900cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP好像满了。\\n……我会展现出至今为止的成果的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "446497bcfba887056e25a2428e371c7b0e98254ba83f0430607272f935eca0b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98c3e78fa0769328431f4d1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！出阵的时刻到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6eabeae6957913be480426ae6317cff737e4033ba9e50b96e0995016c094d7e9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f984bac596ffa14130c2ad7b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了……啊啊……已经按捺不住了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddf89298692bc881c1bdae0afcabfbde00f4c02b8158a14ad3a281960b587645",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4da7c27bc6d240ceac3b2430",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦！今天也要在赛事里\\n让大家Happy哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d242fadd8f4585d5ba48d4d7a0c22bc44a27d8d07dbc3067b4f0be94fdd63f3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab93733ab8ad1792edab5b1b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP恢复了！奔赴赛事的舞台吧！\\n一切……都是为了宣传苫小牧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ce2c3b2932c857d81220ffcd1a729bafb42652e04174ebad736ee881f171f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ded16376b784b6fb1d8dd18",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀，RP好像满了呢。\\n吃点脆脆饼，去赢一把吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca4a2b8e3045239f44bf18792b61a1d76e8072bc72980fbcfcbb8394eeb386ff",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:159a6e8f4b223207ed8d0b63",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP溢出来了……就像对你的Amore一样呢。\\n把这份燃烧的思念，在赛事中展现出来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d660facd4a8b7d387f4629d76c3cf4e0a0c1ff3d12a398c136e207f553fc14d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cce1bf3bc4aeb60fa31b5a5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP完全恢复了。\\n那么，Let's·小莱斯·Appeal！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2abbb0ecac448312246e1351615ce6a7767a2db96ea3faf18c02ddef4d0cf64f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1103"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de5f69441c35cb01bf722d6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！去挑战\\n那些强敌吧，作为王牌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "594fd04ead1c25b33e4dc99ff7e3eb3f6ad1c0515ff2dc955c7f6a7bb3d5e219",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1104"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b276f1771cc56e33d158192",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "『RP』满了。\\n想在“Rendezvous”中感到『兴奋』呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "60fb351a15ce54a303fdf48eaba233134dfc7c67e1366473717aea7caaa2609c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1105"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4377235ae4ea5a4315b5480",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP恢复了呢。\\n我会尽力而为的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3237fc4b5f0ea2f039781de58a3c621718eae318b65772b564d447052c7f4bee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1106"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e078edbbc7b599d9b34e7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了！来吧，比赛！\\n不断积累胜利，总有一天要建起城堡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5aff04b0d6dd6cc4b8a4b215ac2b04c3a26564c14a0786eb48c87441f274b979",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1107"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5116f8c461391c65978283f1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了。\\n去证明实力吧——向着赛场出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b76bd0ce7e69b21dfd9c22a247769457e9d6e64e90d15324bf6a678c0c98be2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1108"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cde96c49d1afbf865960d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了。\\n去挑战新的赛事吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55c48083d51d5df81b75063d3d6d488f54ad2b9fa9e464a2297eabbb3a8947a2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1109"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d86e0d7e931820810433b5be",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP攒满了。\\n准备好了就出发吧，我们一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5a1f9f1a1035b7df35d9bb21e8435d66a73d8d2bdddf8c72846582bcd295d3f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1110"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c556c425903ec7befa15af1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "向您报告RP已充分积累。\\n我认为这是展示成果的好机会，您意下如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "346c527cf5ee5b5fc17e65921456f5829d8357f41b7bf8fc63bde2f279f8920a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cde2a71c6157f40114a8954",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经恢复了！Tick-tock!\n比赛时间到啦！Don't keep me waiting♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3723310a2a0ed432d865cdd40a96e3b228a96c0c56758f46e3ec1989c43af7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26590e94def49208544edb1a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊！RP满了～！\\n难道说天才要出场了？真拿你没办法～♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "08921fcf079ab4ba679aa233adbc800f8ba2f0fbea1a51e64fab618b5fb22cdb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fecb71f2769795e867a06d0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【带有可爱画像的便条】\\nRP满了哦！朝着“绝景”努力吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8108ff51705611995f7f4449d4a00e9829eebb909ad91d3e536dcdb0573b0c76",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7582ec1c7bf261f9e81e40c5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP……你打算就这么让它闲置着吗？\\n尽好身为臣子的义务吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9608f29f70c1f7c81991cc425cba99d35a3cd4f162b45453b5bd3f70492b6d30",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55bef3882a2fae57a5bf5402",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经达到上限了哦。\\n不断积累胜利，作为通向最强的基石吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae1ca8a0bfcce790da048e07bea2bc2d432b530e2bb7235c234220c6a594a486",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:194f9801f7e64558c8355f96",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经MAX了。为了能展现出\\n训练的成果……我会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cabecbd2601e363572b301ec11f6f9fbed590069c703ed2429a6344ee87d111",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8182546b047f2b1fdc02d538",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP终于回满了。\\n……一切已准备就绪，我在赛场先行一步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35ce6d7b3b3d65e530b095234a61ed729f1a8f8913db70891077ada12deb542b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:344dabba8d5971e9d30ab8ec",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP恢复了呢。\\n那么，出发去参加赛事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f838866a49b72f35047baf69b842faaed25063ae0794e58247af9f5d540b0936",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42e0933b6ff77cd0ced3ad61",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了。\\n请允许我说一句：大干一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f888be0cbaf6c266ff9fbb0845dc08b883ffd53316f33442b554f555097a92",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43ff05d5c74c7d9814dbce3d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP恢复……无论是什么样的赛事，\\n我都做好了共同征战的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1729e188b2d1f9d2e771da2933342c8547b7fb3ec973d3399c3d9936dafabaa",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6fb2b19f830f83a469f1bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，RP恢复了哦！\\n快去赛场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "83142dfa2411460b7d742af0cc47bb52da3c07306cee80ab767c19ee1a0d4e49",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7065458bace5930467742a5f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已满！\\n正义之心的准备也已完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e59e4b9237128af4d04f506a944e5d138c95ce40534add45b71980b0aef5255",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eeffd120a1eee1f747a49898",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦！\\n来吧，赢下去，赢下去，不断赢下去吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de30af38615424771e34361de7125d6603c2460f2a544d32febbfbe126c3a870",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934b3c49392036afa60b069a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经回满了。准备工作早已经做好了\\n——就在此刻，让我们……华丽地绽放吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce612a45785e91e21da6a30aeaa4865883ed8b692813100c740f92a112a19e85",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead895d76fa007cf80bafdbe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了！\\n去证明吧！一哩跑者的实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b19467f5f2baec48c938e12ed27867c99ef0990e67f8c4695ee36e07802d13a5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df330e7c7a0ea10e6a582171",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了哦。一起去传递爱吧！\\n向着全世界♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "137ff108681d397091b1d61e755bdb0a46b4de18fe1d1a20d04b086ff3b186c7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c6383fab5e1e7889a78e051",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP满了。那个，还有……\\n去创造新的历史吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2224f848d8bb90e66273a509f096da7ee668ad3928008dd7f27dcdde6875a4c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920d624883f155d4e17d3299",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经回满了。嘉德丽雅、月桂树——\n下一场比赛，您希望献上什么样的花束呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b37b407b6ab047d9d20dba12306c18a6e823db265c60b96c1922b45fda238061",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6242ecc63dcd7335ff7f8535",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已经满了。\\n去看看美丽的风景吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ae938d166ac2894093da99f5cbf09052e3ad65b7894eba0a82afdbab22c027",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "185",
        "1135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1c51e197d142ea1aab891b2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "RP已积满。\n让我们一同积累胜利，成为真正的圣女吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35039003364f9e8ee8889e3e74ee2cc32e4ce40b65f22b1431f08b9daff04b73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
